{"response": "Le contexte fourni ne contient pas d'informations permettant de répondre à votre question concernant les défauts dimensionnels sur les pièces produites.

Le document 'mds_channel_parameter_en.pdf' (page 318) décrit uniquement le paramètre « Contouring method in inch units » (P-CHAN-00439) et la spécification de valeurs en pouces ou en millimètres avec G70 actif, sans aborder les causes de défauts de production.", "retrieved_contexts": ["2.94 Contouring method in inch units (P-CHAN-00439)
Description, Contouring method in inch units = So far, certain parameter values could only be specified in mm for contour smoothing methods with an active G70, e.g. #CONTOUR MODE, #HSC [BSPLINE..] or #HSC[SUR FACE..]. This compatibility parameter now permits the specification of values in inches with an act ive G70.. Parameter, Contouring method in inch units = contouring_consider_inch. Data type, Contouring method in inch units = BOOLEAN. Data range, Contouring method in inch units = 0: Specify certain parameters only in [mm] with an an active G70. 1: Specify certain parameters only in [inch] with an an active G70.. Dimension, Contouring method in inch units = ----. Default value, Contouring method in inch units = 0. Remarks, Contouring method in inch units = Parameter available as of Build V2.11.2036.3. Only acts when G70 is active."], "retrieved_context_ids": ["4ff1558a-2f27-4261-b015-24f4c43da11f"], "retrieved_context_metadata": [{"filename": "mds_channel_parameter_en.pdf", "page_no": 318, "heading": ["2.94 Contouring method in inch units (P-CHAN-00439)"], "_id": "4ff1558a-2f27-4261-b015-24f4c43da11f", "_collection_name": "Manuals"}], "latency_ms": 26864.680942999257, "theme": null, "mode": "text"}

