AXIS_REF is a data structure used to identify an axis. It must be transferred to individual Function Blocks (FBs) as a VAR_IN_OUT parameter [3]. All AXIS_REF structures must exist for each axis and must be available in all programs pertaining to the PLC project tasks [5]. To ensure this, all AXIS_REF structures are managed in an array with the name g_array_axis_ref [5]. In the context of measuring commands, the current state of the measuring channel is managed in "tp_state" within the AXIS_REF [2].

